Ecoji V2
Author: Keith Turner and the keith-turner/ecoji contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/keith-turner/ecoji
Pinned version: v2.0.2
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The alphabet preserves the ordinal order of emojisV2.txt without modification.
Its representation was changed from hexadecimal code points to a frozen
TypeScript array. The UUID codec adapts the upstream Ecoji V2 bit packing for
fixed 16-byte identifiers and adds strict canonical validation and optional
single U+FE0F variation-selector normalization.

